<title>VENEZUELA: Sivensa Q1 net rises 63 percent.</title>
<headline>Sivensa Q1 net rises 63 percent.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net 1.788 billion bolivars vs 1.098 billion</p>
<p>Sales 74.1 billion bolivars vs 60.8 billion</p>
<p>Cost of sales 62.5 billion bolivars vs 52.9 billion</p>
<p>General expenses 9.5 billion bolivars vs 8.6 billion</p>
<p>Financing cost/gain 1.7 bln bolivar gain vs 5.6 bln gain</p>
<p>Notes: Period ends December 31 1996</p>
<p>Results are in constant December 1996 bolivars</p>
<p>Siderugica Venezolana Sivensa SA is Venezuela's leading steel company.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
